<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Custom Neon Scrollbar Demo</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      background-color: #121216;
      color: #f4f4f6;
    }

    .container {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 820px;
    }

    .card {
      flex: 1 1 340px;
      height: 300px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Light box (default browser scrollbar) */
    .light {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #1e1e24;
      border: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
    }

    /* Dark box (custom scrollbar applied) */
    .dark {
      background-color: #1c1c24;
      color: #e4e4e7;
      border: 1px solid #2e2e3a;
    }

    /* Your custom scrollbar CSS */
    .dark::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 8px;
    }

    .dark::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: linear-gradient(#00eaff, #ff00ff);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Optional: dark track so the gradient stands out cleanly */
    .dark::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #14141a;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Box WITH your .dark class -->
    <div class="card dark">
      <h2>.dark Container (Custom Scrollbar)</h2>
      <p>Scroll inside this container to see your cyan-to-magenta gradient scrollbar thumb in action.</p>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus lacinia odio vitae vestibulum vestibulum. Cras venenatis euismod malesuada.</p>
      <p>Nullam ac erat ante. Integer aliquet, libero at varius commodo, justo magna dictum tortor, in pretium urna sapien vel elit.</p>
      <p>Curabitur nec lacus elit. Pellentesque convallis nisi ac augue pharetra eu tristique neque consequat. Mauris ornare tempor nulla.</p>
      <p>End of scrollable content.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Box WITHOUT .dark class for comparison -->
    <div class="card light">
      <h2>.light Container (Default Scrollbar)</h2>
      <p>This container does not have the <code>.dark</code> class, so it uses your browser's default scrollbar.</p>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus lacinia odio vitae vestibulum vestibulum. Cras venenatis euismod malesuada.</p>
      <p>Nullam ac erat ante. Integer aliquet, libero at varius commodo, justo magna dictum tortor, in pretium urna sapien vel elit.</p>
      <p>Curabitur nec lacus elit. Pellentesque convallis nisi ac augue pharetra eu tristique neque consequat. Mauris ornare tempor nulla.</p>
      <p>End of scrollable content.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
